         [#D7D7AF][/dim]living-note tiers to `[[` link completion so machinery and zorg [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]satellites stop crowding the 20 suggestion slots, and a line-less [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]note open records a Vim jump so `<C-o>` returns to where Bryan was.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]2[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]note_goto_followups.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/note_goto_followups.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-mb[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-mb/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: shared note tiers and `capture-complete -A` archive [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]catalog[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-archive-scope[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-archive-scope: give `note_catalog` one shared path-tier predicate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](living, archive, hidden), add an archive catalog of top-level done/ [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notes, superseded library folders, and zorg daily satellites, and serve [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]it behind a new `capture-complete -A/--archived-notes` flag with an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`archived` marker; help, docs, and tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-cli: living notes first in vault-wide `[[` link completion[bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cli-link-tiers[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-archive-scope[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli-link-tiers: tag every `[[` note-index entry with the shared tier and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]order (or drop, per decision link_tiers) archive and hidden notes after [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]living matches in `[[note`, `[[##`, `[[^^`, and record link-value [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]suggestions, leaving target-scoped completion and link resolution [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]unchanged.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Recent group in the empty `//` picker from an app-local [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]open log[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-recent-notes[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-recent-notes: record each successful `//` open in an app-local, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]schema-versioned open log, show up to eight recently opened notes as a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Recent section after Today in the empty Notes picker, add a Settings [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]action that clears the log, and land green on macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mac: Command-X toggles Go To · Archive in the `//` picker[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac-archive-scope[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli-archive-scope, mac-recent-notes[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac-archive-scope: claim the reserved Command-X in Notes to toggle a Go [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]To · Archive scope fed by `capture-complete --archived-notes`, with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stale-safe scope state, archive rows and groups, an old-bob hint, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]generated fixtures, docs, and green exact-SHA macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob-plugins: line-less bob-open-notes opens record a `<C-o>` [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]jump[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]plugin-open-notes-jump[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plugin-open-notes-jump: in bob-navigation-hotkeys, record a Vim jump [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]from the prior caret to the landed note when `obsidian://bob-open-notes`[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]opens a Markdown note without a line, with tests, docs, and a deployed [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sync.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-mb","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-mb.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-04356e496a68ef94f899d438fc8260fe","started_at":"2026-11-16T15:17:06.254363+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"787c78e9d7173ab3b9688e08713d23e7c0c8e4f7f3c3bac08a0f2977fdba9598","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/chat.md","size_bytes":9443},"commits":{"digest":"2cc1db9938f346fab222399fcc6fd002471cdd6d95f17b96df35159812be16b3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"cf34ff6020fc0969522748b5647ff6b56e636439d3bbe5e3d9632ed8c7c735f9","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":64},"meta":{"digest":"96359302b2d643528d50adf3bbabab3983166e630df9f4529c5db79c8e675e44","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/meta.json","size_bytes":676},"prompt":{"digest":"43c5987ce8c078d4ae2447f0803965b52d78ebe38ac137424eca84914a825b58","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/prompt.md","size_bytes":2841},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"57443e15addf7ffcc5ed4e8f1cc62b0952a851482eac88fd03d1824ebb85c5ec","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-mb.3--2/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":901},"state":{"digest":"5f1a51b73ca813cebf6b6b70c687b299a8b661496836c71b440d9f04804c71a8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob